# UniGetUI machine-specific runtime state (not meaningful to track across machines)
Config/UniGetUI/OperationHistory
Config/UniGetUI/CurrentSessionToken
Config/UniGetUI/WindowGeometry
Config/UniGetUI/TelemetryClientToken
Config/UniGetUI/IpcApiEndpoints/
# UI state and what UniGetUI already upgraded on this machine
Config/UniGetUI/SidepanelWidths.json
Config/UniGetUI/WinGetAlreadyUpgradedPackages.json
Config/UniGetUI/LastKnownBuildNumber

# UniGetUI package backups an older setup wrote to the repo root (the WinGet lists in Config/WinGet replace them)
/*.ubundle

# UniGetUI's package backup folder, a local path
Config/UniGetUI/ChangeBackupOutputDirectory
